pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 一致性页：左边把抢单协议当实验步骤念五步，右边信誉分账表加三条事务规则。
elements:
  - elementId: head-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 20, 420, 12]
    content: {style: "$metaLabel", wrap: false, text: 济跑跑工程档案 · CAMPUS RUNNER DOSSIER}
  - elementId: head-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [512, 20, 400, 12]
    content: {style: "$metaLabel", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: 一致性 · CONSISTENCY · 2026-08}
  - elementId: head-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 40, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: headline
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 60, 840, 40]
    content: {style: "$headline", fontSize: 28, wrap: false, text: 两个人同时抢一个单，会怎么样}
  # 左：抢单协议
  - elementId: proto-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 116, 300, 12]
    content: {style: "$metaLabel", wrap: false, text: 程序一 · 并发抢单协议}
  - elementId: proto-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 138, 440, 236]
    shapeName: rect
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: proto-steps
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 154, 396, 204]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.95
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">1.</span> SELECT … FOR UPDATE 锁定任务行</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">2.</span> 锁定跑腿员行</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">3.</span> 重读状态：任务 WAITING 且跑腿员 FREE</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">4.</span> 同事务写入接派、任务、跑腿员、日志四表</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">5.</span> 提交；任一步失败整体回滚</p>
  - elementId: proto-result
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 388, 440, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>结果：两个人同时抢同一单，<span style="color:$crimson;">只有先拿到锁的那个提交成功</span>，表里不会多出一条接派记录。</p>
  # 右：信誉分账
  - elementId: credit-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 116, 372, 12]
    content: {style: "$metaLabel", wrap: false, text: 表二 · 信誉分账}
  - elementId: credit-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [540, 138, 372, 168]
    columnWidths: [0.5, 0.5]
    rowHeights: [0.22, 0.13, 0.13, 0.13, 0.13, 0.13, 0.13]
    style:
      cellStyle:
        fontSize: 10.5
        fontFamily: MiSans
        color: "$ink"
        align: [left, middle]
        border: null
      firstRowStyle:
        bold: true
        fontSize: 10
        color: "$meta"
        border: [{style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}, null, {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$ink"}, null]
      lastRowStyle:
        border: [null, null, {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}, null]
    rows:
      - - text: 　行为
        - text: 信誉分变动
      - - text: 　评价 5 星
        - text: "+2"
      - - text: 　评价 4 星
        - text: "+1"
      - - text: 　评价 3 星
        - text: "0"
      - - text: 　评价 2 星 / 1 星
        - text: −1 / −2
      - - text: 　投诉成立
        - text: |
            <p><span style="color:$crimson;">−10</span></p>
  - elementId: credit-rules
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 322, 372, 98]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">·</span> 评价写入与信誉分调整在<strong>同一事务</strong>，失败整体回滚</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">·</span> 修改 / 删除评价按差额回滚，信誉分下限为 0</p>
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">·</span> 门槛：任务 FINISHED + 支付 PAID + 无活动退款，一任务一次</p>
  # 底部
  - elementId: bottom-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 448, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: bottom-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 462, 864, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 10, fontFamily: MiSans, color: "$meta", wrap: false, text: 同类事务边界同样约束：发布任务、派单重派、配送状态、确认付款、退款审核、结算与审计写入。}
  - elementId: folio
    elementType: text
    bounds: [430, 514, 100, 14]
    content: {style: "$folio", align: [center, top], wrap: false, text: — 09 —}
